1 59530 59561 NULL SDHDF v2.3 installed; Effective from and including UTC 2021-11-11-11:07:57; Fix NPOL bug in calibration data - CONTINUUM_OUTSTOKES is incorrectly set in Medusa cal data file to 1 when NPOL=4; Fix empty metadata query logging and append to history dataset; Fix integration time out by half a dump; Fix PULSE@Parkes data processing for spectral line modules
